  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — OpenAI Drops GPT-6 Astra — Huang Calls It AGI | September 7, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — OpenAI Drops GPT-6 Astra — Huang Calls It AGI | September 7, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              September 7, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              OpenAI Drops GPT-6 Astra — Huang Calls It AGI\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">OpenAI has launched <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTkFVX3lxTE11QUxBUVJLdC1jSmtJbmcxQzg4Qm9yUlNPS3JEMEVBanIyY1FRT2k2R0hBTlNnX2VqcWpTSDJUMDV0TjBJN1VGamlrZzVPZw?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">GPT-6, branded Astra</a>, its most capable model yet — and Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang promptly declared that <strong>AGI has arrived</strong>. Whether or not that holds scrutiny, the market reaction is real: memory chip stocks surged, legal AI firms began integrations within hours, and every financial services boardroom now has a new question on the agenda.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">OpenAI launched GPT-6 Astra, calling it \"a new generation of intelligence\" — a direct step-change from prior model generations</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang publicly endorsed the AGI framing and congratulated the OpenAI team, signalling that compute demand will accelerate further</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">The launch immediately reignited the memory chip trade, with investors betting on sustained AI infrastructure spend</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Legal AI firms Harvey and Legora have already begun evaluating GPT-6 Astra for their platforms — a signal of rapid enterprise adoption velocity</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">At least one OpenAI scientist issued a public AI risk warning concurrent with the launch — a rare public internal dissent at a major model release</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">The launch sets a new performance benchmark that Gemini, Grok 4.5, and Claude will all be measured against</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Every major bank's AI strategy just got a shorter shelf life. GPT-6 Astra represents a step-change in model capability, and if legal firms are already integrating it, financial services firms face pressure to accelerate their own AI roadmaps or risk falling visibly behind. For banks running internal AI proof-of-concepts, the goalposts have moved — again.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">The \"AGI has arrived\" declaration — however debatable — will land in the boardroom. Executives who've held a cautious wait-and-see posture will face new pressure from boards to show AI momentum. Risk and compliance teams should take the accompanying AI safety warnings seriously: more capable models mean more capable threats, and AI-assisted malware is already appearing in the wild from nation-state actors.</p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>Incore Bank trials Gemini-powered KYC with Kyndryl</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNTEpCWUZROHNjRzV3b05GNGRRaVJhcUJHOFhvSE1NNjR5UHFHeHl3bTJOTXlNTWdZem9ic0dwZEVoRGJaZkFiV3pveFFQYjNveEw0WXRLbU5jNk56bkxLMzlWVDhXOTRhMi1uQU1KcW1MRUZwdlluTEhRQ29FZHM0bG55QlNsSUFGbE44RDRR?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">FinTech Global</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Incore Bank is piloting a Gemini-powered KYC workflow built with Kyndryl, applying Google's multimodal AI to identity verification and document processing. The trial aims to reduce onboarding times and cut manual review workloads in compliance teams.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>KYC automation reaches pilot production.</strong> If this scales, it validates AI-assisted identity verification as a core banking workflow — reducing cost while improving accuracy for compliance-heavy onboarding.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>Mambu connects AI to core banking with Intelligent Core</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNOWxJU0FWU1F4MTRLNGRHclh0NjljOU1Cc29yemtzVUdGYl9aZVMzNk84UVJvUGJxVWViMEloZDgxTFJjSWdKYWpkS2RiNWpBTmE1ZENBQjhQdW8wR3ROOGpnSjd0SXBaNTJmMUdOWjY1VUZ0eEpvOXcwd2VyUV84SUVDZDBYdw?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">FutureCIO</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Cloud banking platform Mambu launched Intelligent Core, embedding AI capabilities directly into its core banking engine. Banks on Mambu can now deploy AI-driven credit scoring and fraud detection without custom middleware or third-party integrations.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>AI embedded in core, not bolted on.</strong> Intelligent Core removes a major friction point for banks — getting AI to act on core banking data without custom integration layers — which could compress deployment timelines significantly.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>South Korea's KB Financial Group Hosts AI Agent Competition; Woori Bank Launches Ethical Hacking Contest to Secure Talent</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE5VREthRWRReTBPaWFKVF9fS1ZFMWZxYWdweFdRbG1JOFBneVF2elgwQk1ENnllbFlYWEtaZk1Fa0ZZejdQWjJSZlJleDZaVUFGend3X2V5YWF0WXhCYUFHSlJsVkVHMXpTaHA1ZVlYVlBqZklBeVE?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">finance.biggo.com</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            KB Financial Group ran an internal AI agent competition and immediately applied winning projects to live workflows. Rival Woori Bank simultaneously launched an ethical hacking contest — two of South Korea's largest financial groups racing to operationalise AI and cybersecurity talent.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Asian banks are moving from pilots to production fast.</strong> KB Financial's model — internal competition → direct deployment — is a playbook that compresses the innovation-to-operations gap and sets a benchmark for other institutions.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>North Korea's Kimsuky First Spotted Mass-Producing Malware with AI Coding Agent</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTFBIUk1BNXFibkhSbUJXV2FGTm9nYThCYzNvRzcwMnJhV2dXUHhwdVZ6Nzc4WUZUWHY0TVpLYlg5TWZwVHdXcHJQdGhsNkNudGZxU2Q2elBzX3dRbk5HQ2NiLTBBalE5Z1RUOU40YTBIalJBNFdRN0E?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">finance.biggo.com</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            North Korea's Kimsuky threat group has been observed using AI coding agents to mass-produce malware variants at scale — the first confirmed case of a nation-state actor automating malware production via AI, dramatically lowering the cost and speed of sophisticated cyberattacks.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>AI-accelerated state threats are no longer theoretical.</strong> Financial institutions — prime Kimsuky targets — must assume attack variant volume will now scale independently of human developer capacity, demanding faster detection and response cycles.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>Binance launches AI Agent Skills for unified market data access and asset management</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOZmg0SkJWSkJ5c2RIUWNKdmIzMHJLS3pqb2NZS3g0aTlSbGR2clZwclBubkJoaWhHVHc1azZjUGNybWVwMkpaX3lMc2dtZVpKc0ZDal9raEtOb2N1NnZhTGN4RGx1WjNaV1JuSkZfVkc4UW40TE52TENPUDZHWDYxQjlkaXlfNjV4ZTJpUElDdUV6RW8?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">tradersunion.com</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Binance launched AI Agent Skills, a framework giving AI agents direct programmatic access to unified market data and asset management functions on its platform. This positions Binance as an AI-native trading infrastructure provider rather than a traditional exchange.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Crypto exchanges are outpacing TradFi on agentic market infrastructure.</strong> Banks building automated trading or treasury operations desks should treat Binance's approach as a live benchmark for what AI-native market access looks like.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Things to Know → Startups -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── AGENTIC STARTUPS SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Agentic Startups to Watch 🚀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Startup entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- Startup entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Company name + tagline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            <strong>1. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOZ3dHMDlCRzhadUI1a1k1ZXdmUGtSc1MyYkprSDlLMl93RWM1dDRzVGpxNm1xOFBqS0dtNVV6U0w1Z3JjVmtKV01sNGtrcUZ5WGYtcWhodTBhZWRWY0VBVVdxbUdjc0J1cF84cnU2LUx3aDI0Zm11RkVwaVExU095THJLLXhpZ3NITU5sbFp6em9QRXNfUHNUSHhINEcyZUFudnZBVkYwTko2VVpyRE45MFA5clRmeXlGUUdn?oc=5\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">Portio</a></strong> &mdash; <strong>Structured AgentOps platform for orchestrating and governing enterprise AI agent workflows</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Portio has highlighted its Structured AgentOps Workflow approach, positioning itself as the operational governance layer that makes enterprise AI agents reliable, auditable, and production-ready at scale.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Analysis bullet -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 14px;font-size: